reliquary-general

The code in this package is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE), except
reliquary_general/_ifeval/, which is Apache-2.0 (see the LICENSE beside it).

The prompt corpus this package serves is published separately, as the Hugging
Face dataset ReliquaryForge/general-prompts-curated, and pinned by revision and
digest; the wheel does not contain it. It is derived from the datasets below. Every row names its source in its `source` field and keeps the
upstream identifier in its `key`. Only prompts are redistributed: no upstream
response, rubric or preference is included, except the frozen earlier turns of
a multi-turn conversation or tool transcript, which are part of the prompt.
Licences were read on each dataset card at the pinned revision on 2026-10-09.

